  elsarticle.cls, elsarticle-num.bst, elsarticle-num-names.bst,
  elsarticle-harv.bst
      The official Elsevier article class, elsarticle 3.5 (2026/01/09),
      Copyright 2007-2026 Elsevier Ltd, under the LaTeX Project Public
      License 1.3 or later, as stated in the file headers. As distributed by
      CTAN and TeX Live (https://ctan.org/pkg/elsarticle; the archive
      https://mirrors.ctan.org/systems/texlive/tlnet/archive/elsarticle.tar.xz). Redistributed unmodified, so that the
      template compiles offline.

The packages the sample loads come from the built-in Tectonic bundle under
their own licenses. Check the guide for authors of your journal at
https://www.elsevier.com for the rules that apply to your submission.
